<title>CANADA: Cineplex Odeon to build 4 new theaters.</title>
<headline>Cineplex Odeon to build 4 new theaters.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cineplex Odeon Corp said it plans to build four new multi-screen theater complexes in Canada.</p>
<p>The theater-chain owner said it will build two 10-screen and one 12-screen complex in Ontario as well as an 11-screen complex in St. Bruno, Quebec.</p>
<p>Cineplex said the four new complexes will offer state-of-the-art film presentation, Dolby digital sound, luxurious seating and access for disabled persons.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
